WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:06.945
Roxy gulped as cars and trucks slid in the wet paint.

2
00:00:06.946 --> 00:00:09.777
"They're all going to crash!" she thought.

3
00:00:09.778 --> 00:00:14.833
Zoom! Roxy jumped in front of a big truck and stopped it.

4
00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:17.413
Two cars slid toward each other.

5
00:00:17.414 --> 00:00:19.839
Roxy flew over and stood between them.

6
00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:23.448
She held out her arms and stopped both cars.

7
00:00:23.449 --> 00:00:26.329
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!" one driver said.

8
00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:28.838
"No problem," Roxy said.

9
00:00:28.839 --> 00:00:34.198
Then she flew off, following Kid Squid's paint trail.

10
00:00:34.199 --> 00:00:38.073
*** "The mural looks great, students!" Mr. Barns

11
00:00:38.074 --> 00:00:42.035
said. "I can paint better than that!" a voice

12
00:00:42.036 --> 00:00:44.742
shouted. Mr. Barns and the students turned

13
00:00:44.743 --> 00:00:47.915
around. A girl in a squid suit stood across the street.

14
00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:52.901
"I'm Kid Squid, and I'm a talented artist!" she said.

15
00:00:52.902 --> 00:00:55.885
Kid Squid aimed one of her arms at the mural.

16
00:00:55.886 --> 00:01:00.413
"Don't you dare ruin that mural!" Roxy swooped down from the sky.

17
00:01:00.414 --> 00:01:02.405
She grabbed Kid Squid's arm.

18
00:01:02.406 --> 00:01:05.706
Paint sprayed up into the air.

19
00:01:05.707 --> 00:01:09.960
Wham! Kid Squid slammed Roxy to the street.

20
00:01:09.961 --> 00:01:12.160
"Ouch!" Roxy said.

21
00:01:12.161 --> 00:01:15.878
Kid Squid aimed at the mural again.

22
00:01:15.879 --> 00:01:18.934
Roxy saw the tank on the vandal's back.

23
00:01:18.935 --> 00:01:22.731
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams shot out.

24
00:01:22.732 --> 00:01:26.804
The paint tank exploded, sending paint everywhere.

25
00:01:26.805 --> 00:01:29.596
Drops of paint landed all over the street.

26
00:01:29.597 --> 00:01:33.901
Mr. Barns' face lit up. "That looks beautiful!"

27
00:01:33.902 --> 00:01:36.110
Kid Squid tried to shoot more paint.

28
00:01:36.111 --> 00:01:40.506
But nothing came out. She stamped her foot. "Ugh!"

29
00:01:40.507 --> 00:01:47.523
Roxy quickly grabbed Kid Squid and flew back to the art gallery.

30
00:01:47.524 --> 00:01:51.251
Detective Smith was inside, talking to the owner.

31
00:01:51.252 --> 00:01:56.057
Roxy dragged Kid Squid through the door. "I caught the—"

32
00:01:56.058 --> 00:02:01.865
"Yay! The artist is back!" the owner cried.

33
00:02:01.866 --> 00:02:04.521
"Huh?" Roxy was confused.

34
00:02:04.522 --> 00:02:10.166
"The gallery owner thinks Kid Squid is very talented," Detective Smith said.

35
00:02:10.167 --> 00:02:12.657
The owner ran over to Kid Squid.

36
00:02:12.658 --> 00:02:15.001
"I'd like to have a show with your paintings.

37
00:02:15.002 --> 00:02:19.260
Your abstract art will make a big splash in the art world!" Kid

38
00:02:19.261 --> 00:02:22.172
Squid smiled. "Really?" The

39
00:02:22.173 --> 00:02:25.906
owner nodded. "You're going to be famous!" "You

40
00:02:25.907 --> 00:02:29.860
have to do something else first though," Detective Smith said. "Clean

41
00:02:29.861 --> 00:02:34.768
up the messes you made. And you can't be a vandal anymore." Kid

42
00:02:34.769 --> 00:02:40.135
Squid sighed. "Okay." ***

43
00:02:40.136 --> 00:02:41.898
Roxy returned to the mural.

44
00:02:41.899 --> 00:02:46.948
"Roxy!" Mara said. "You missed Rocket Girl!"

45
00:02:46.949 --> 00:02:50.556
"Really?" Roxy said, pretending to be surprised.

46
00:02:50.557 --> 00:02:52.208
Jack pointed at the street.

47
00:02:52.209 --> 00:02:55.953
"She made that big abstract painting in the street!"

48
00:02:55.954 --> 00:03:01.424
Terrell smiled. "See? Rocket Girl is an artist."

49
00:03:01.425 --> 00:03:06.063
Roxy shrugged. "I guess I was wrong!"

50
00:03:06.064 --> 00:03:14.891
Then she picked up a brush and started painting.

